nd ask about it. Laptops never got that trick. Here is the same gesture on your Mac, and because you…"/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.voiceos.com/blog/circle-to-search-on-your-computer"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en" href="https://www.voiceos.com/blog/circle-to-search-on-your-computer"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="ja" href="https://www.voiceos.com/ja/blog/circle-to-search-on-your-computer"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="x-default" href="https://www.voiceos.com/blog/circle-to-search-on-your-computer"/><meta name="google-site-verification" content="uFUtX2rdWjK_rXafEbA9qRvv_m7amTpZJMnUywraMXg"/><meta property="og:title" content="Circle to Search, But for Your Whole Computer"/><meta property="og:description" content="On a phone you draw a circle around something on screen and ask about it. Laptops never got that trick. Here is the same gesture on your Mac, and because you can talk while you do it, it goes further."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.voiceos.com/blog/circle-to-search-on-your-computer"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://www.voiceos.com/blogs/circle-to-search-on-your-computer-v2.png"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:type" content="article"/><meta property="article:published_time" content="2026-07-29T08:00:00.000Z"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Circle to Search, But for Your Whole Computer"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="On a phone you draw a circle around something on screen and ask about it. Laptops never got that trick. Here is the same gesture on your Mac, and because you can talk while you do it, it goes further."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.voiceos.com/blogs/circle-to-search-on-your-computer-v2.png"/><link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="