</filter></defs></svg><div class="glass-content"><div class="flex items-center justify-between w-full gap-9"><div class="flex items-center"><a aria-label="VoiceOS" class="flex items-center cursor-pointer relative" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-[26px] leading-none font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 opacity-100">VoiceOS</span><img alt="VoiceOS logo" aria-hidden="true" width="240" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[14px] md:h-[16px] w-auto opacity-0 absolute" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2FvoiceOsLogo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2FvoiceOsLogo.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2FvoiceOsLogo.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></a></div><div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-7"><div class="relative"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[15px] text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-600 font-medium transition-colors duration-200">Product<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-px text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200 " fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></button></div><a class="text-[15px] text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-600 font-medium transition-colors duration-200" href="/about">About</a><a class="text-[15px] text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-600 font-medium transition-colors duration-200" href="/blog">Blogs</a><a class="text-[15px] text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-600 font-medium transition-colors duration-200" href="/app-store">App Store</a><a href="https://partners.dub.co/voice-os" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[15px] text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-600 font-medium transition-colors duration-200">Affiliates</a><a href="https://api.voiceos.com/delivery/releases/primary/VoiceOS-Installer.dmg" class="nav-download-cta py-2 px-[18px] text-[15px] leading-[22px] rounded-full mr-[-12px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-[18px] h-[18px] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"></span><span>Download</span></a></div><button class="md:hidden text-gray-900 p-2 -mr-2" aria-label="Toggle menu"><svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="hidden md:block absolute top-full -mt-2 z-50 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-200 ease-out opacity-0 pointer-events-none" style="left:0;transform:translate3d(-50%, -6px, 0) scale(0.98);transform-origin:top center;visibility:hidden"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-8 h-8"></div><div class="relative w-[292px] overflow-hidden" style="border-radius:26px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.985) 0%, rgba(250,252,255,0.97) 100%);backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(140%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(140%);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.10), 0 1px 4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.82);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.72);contain:paint"><div class="absolute inset-x-5 top-0 h-px pointer-events-none" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.95), transparent)"></div><div class="relative z-10 p-2"><a class="group relative block rounded-[18px] px-3.5 py-3 transition-colors duration-200" href="/features/agent"><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[18px] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-visible:opacity-100" style="background:rgba(15,23,42,0.04)"></div><span class="relative z-10 block text-[15px] font-semibold leading-tight text-gray-900">Agent Mode</span><span class="relative z-10 mt-1 block text-[13px] font-light leading-snug text-gray-500">Say it, and it gets done</span></a><a class="group relative block rounded-[18px] px-3.5 py-3 transiti